{
  "id": "ZEC.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "ZEC",
  "reference": "Sekaria 9",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 17,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ZEC 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bwa ne nyonjin bororiosiek che mi ole negit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lautietab ng’olyotab Jehovah agobo emetab Hadrak, ak egu Damasko ole tebe: amu tokyingei Jehovah bik tugul ak bororiosiek tugul che bo Israel: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "koboto Hamat agine ne mi kiwotennyi: Turo ak Sidon, amu ng’omen mising’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiteekyigei Turo irimet, ak kiiyum feda ko u temburiek, ak koyum tahabu che kororon ko u ng’atatekab ortinwek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogeero, onei Kiptaiyat inendet, ak kowirji kimnatennyi nyanjet; ak kebeel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keerei Askelon ak koiyweis; keerei Gasa agine, ak konyor ng’wanindo ne o; ak Ekron agine, amu ililani eng’ kamang’unennyi: ak kobet laitoriat eng’ Gasa, ama kemenyei Askelon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak komeny chito ne bo sarbuch Asdod, ak agesu menotetab Pilistik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aiste korotikyik eng’ kutinnyi, ak aiste tugukyik che kiweechei eng’ kelekyik; ak koek inendet agine ne ng’etu agobo Kamuktaindennyo: ak koigei bounindet eng’ Juda, ak koigei Ekron Jebusindet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ameng’isie ayiem gonnyu si agirinda luget, si mabun chi yoto anan koweegegei: ama mi usindet ne bunei kwenunywa agoi: amu kaageer nguno eng’ konyekyuk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Laitornatetab kalyet ne bo laitoriatab Sion",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baibaitu mising’, ee cheptab Sion; waach, ee cheptab Jerusalem: keero, nyonjinin laitoriandeng’ung’: bo iman inendet, ak kotinyei yetunet; iming’inegei, ak kolong’onu sigiriet, moitab sigiriet ne kirgit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ang’em karitab luget eng’ Epraim, koboto mbartanyit eng’ Jerusalem, ak kiges kwangetab boriet; ak komwachi bororiosiek kalyet: ak iboch bounatennyi nyanjet age agoi nyanjet age, ak koboch Ainet agoi tabanwekab ng’ony.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaberuretab Jehovah eng’ Juda ak Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago eng’ inye, ko kiayokte kimonjororiniguk eng’ keringet ne mami beek, amu korotikab kayomiseng’ung’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oweekyige irimet, okwek kimonjororinik che otinye kamang’unet: agot rani amwae ale, ageerun konyil aeng’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kiarikyige Juda ko u kwanget, ak agersach Epraim; ak ang’eet weriguk, ee Sion, kobargei ak weriguk, ee, emetab Yunanik, ak ayain iige rotwetab chok ne bo chito ne nyigan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kotook Jehovah eng’ baragunywa, ak kwo ne kipchabennyi ko u kalyelet: ak koguut Kiptaiyat Jehovah iriaget, ak kwo koboto kipchurjurinik che bo murot ne bo tai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak korib Jehovah ne bo lugosiek ichek; ak koges, ak kotiekyi ng’ony koik che kiwirtoe borowet; ak koeeiso, ak kowaakyo ko u che kaee divaik: ak kinyiit ko u tabok, ko u luukwekab kaptisisiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kosor Jehovah Kamuktaindenywa ichek eng’ betunoto ko u akwetab kechirekab bikyik: amu tun kergeitu ak koik che bo chepkulet, ne kinamjin barak mising’ eng’ emennyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu o ne tia mieindanyi, ak o ne tia kororonindanyi! Igochin bek murenik konerio, ak kogochin divaik che leelach tibik konerio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
